WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Return to your trip. Click My trips to find the itineraries you have already generated. Your trip stays available whenever you want to consult it.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Your trip card, ready. Identify your route and open its card. Your PDF and Excel downloads are here too. For this walkthrough, we open the trip originally generated in English.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:27.500
All your cities. Your route lives in one connected space. Choose the city you want to explore from here. Each destination keeps its dates and organized days.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:42.500
Connectivity and protection. Explore eSIM and travel-insurance options for the whole journey, without searching city by city. Check coverage, terms and prices with the provider before booking.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:48.000
Choose your city. We open Segovia to explore a complete day, from the morning through the return journey. Each destination has its own travel workspace.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.500
Open the itinerary. Switch to Itinerary to see the day organized with times, activities and local travel. The other tab brings together options to prepare your visit.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:11.500
Prepare a route. Choose an origin and destination, then plan the route. You can open Google Maps or Waze next. You can also use your current location as the origin, if you allow location access.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:23.500
This is how the day starts. The day starts at 09:55, moving from the Aqueduct through the historic center to the Cathedral. Times, activity lengths and transfers help you understand the pace of the day.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:48.500
The detail behind each stop. Open an activity to read the route, duration, transport and complete recommendations. Here you can read the Cathedral notes within the same Segovia day.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:02:05.500
All the way to your return. Continue through lunch, visits, viewpoints and the transfer back to Madrid. Review the full day, then explore any activity in greater depth when you need it.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:11.000
Now, prepare your visit. Switch to For your trip to explore options connected with the journey you already have. Your itinerary and the options to prepare it stay within the same city.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Tickets and reservations. Review admission options and providers connected with visits in this destination. Confirm opening times, availability, terms and prices before booking.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:33.000
Tours and experiences. Explore guided alternatives and experiences to compare with your independent route. You decide whether an option fits what you want to experience.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Getting around. Find transport options related to this trip and compare the outbound and return legs. Your day has taken shape. Now choose how you want to live it.
